B.x_=new A.bj(B.x9,["The Rite of Election","Home","Program","Photos","Translate","Map","Altar call","Info & FAQ","News","Ended","Now","News","News and updates about the Rite of Election will appear here.","Featured","All","Stories","Videos","Story","Video","Podcast","Event","Stories from The Catholic Sun, the official news source of the Diocese of Phoenix.","Announcement","Listening: {name}","Welcome","Program","Photos","Translation","Map","Altar call","Info","now","in {n} day","in {n} days","in {h} h {m} min","in {m} min","Select your parish\u2026","Your parish","Section","Section {n}","Station","Photo time","See it on the map","Now","Sample data","To be confirmed","Search by name or city","Doors open in","The Rite of Election begins in","The Rite of Election is happening now!","Thank you for joining us. God bless you!","days","hours","min","sec","Schedule of the day","My parish","Find your seat","Choose your parish to see your section and photo time.","Photo details","Quick links","Language: English \xb7 Cambiar idioma","Find your photo time","Your photo time","Window {start} \u2013 {end}","Your window is now","Your window has passed \u2014 check in to see the live queue","Photo location","Your parish's photo time will be posted here soon.","Choose your language","Live","Will begin shortly","On air \u2014 tap play","Not available","LIVE","Tap to listen","The audio of the new app is coming in the next version. Meanwhile, listen on rite-of-election.pages.dev.","How to listen","Tap Play","The round button above","Hold the phone to your ear","Like a phone call","Have earbuds?","Even better \u2014 you'll hear it clearer","Save battery","You can lock your screen","The audio will keep playing","Play {name}","Stop {name}","UPPER LEVEL","NO ONE ON THE GRASS","STAGE","IN","OUT","Schematic \u2014 not to scale.","Tap a section or a legend item to learn more.","Section","Your seats and photo meeting point","Find your parish","Legend","general seating","Seats","Each parish sits together in its assigned section, from home plate toward left field.","Restrooms","On the main concourse.","Food trucks","Food and drinks on the outer plaza, on both sides of the stadium.","Parking","Parking lots around the stadium.","Opening Google Maps\u2026","Directions","Information","Questions and help: on the concourse, near home plate.","Medical","On the main concourse, near home plate. Any volunteer can help you find it.","God is inviting you to take a next step. Whatever your step is today, let us know \u2014 someone from your parish will follow up with you.","My response","Your name","Other / not listed","Email or phone","So your parish can follow up with you.","I want to\u2026 (choose at least one)","Deepen my faith","Serve in my parish","Come back to Mass and the sacraments","Be contacted by someone from my parish","Anything else? (optional)","Send my response","Sending\u2026","Your response is shared only with the Diocese of Phoenix and your parish.","Please enter your name.","Please choose your parish.","Please enter a valid email or a phone number with area code.","Please choose at least one option.","Thank you!","We're praying for you. Someone from your parish will be in touch.","Demo mode: your response was saved on this device only.","Back to Home","Send another response","Good to know","Frequently asked questions","Messages from our bishops","Watch video","Coming soon","Contact","Contact details coming soon. Meanwhile, please ask your parish OCIA or RE director.","About this app","The official event app for the Rite of Election, Diocese of Phoenix. It works without an account and stores only your preferences on this device.","Version {v}","Sheet music coming soon","Pinch to zoom \xb7 turn your phone for a bigger view","Reconnecting\u2026 showing the last update."],t.li)
